sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React UI
    participant Store as ConfigStore
    participant Bridge as PyWebView Bridge
    participant API as ConfigAPI
    participant Loader as Config Loader
    participant PY as Strategy.py
    participant JSON as Override JSON
    participant YAML as config.yaml

    Note over UI: On strategy selector change
    UI->>Store: dispatch: loadStrategyConfig(name)
    activate Store
    
    Store->>Bridge: window.pywebview.api.get_strategy_config(name)
    Bridge->>API: ConfigAPI.get_strategy_config(name)
    activate API
    
    API->>Loader: load_strategy_config(name)
    activate Loader
    
    Note over Loader: Step 1: Load DEFAULT_CONFIG
    Loader->>PY: getattr(StrategyClass, 'DEFAULT_CONFIG')
    PY-->>Loader: default_config dict
    
    Note over Loader: Step 2: Check for override file
    Loader->>JSON: read config/strategy_overrides/{name}.json
    alt Override exists
        JSON-->>Loader: override_config dict
    else No override
        Loader->>Loader: override_config = {}
    end
    
    Note over Loader: Step 3: Merge configs
    Loader->>Loader: merged = {**default, **override}
    
    Note over Loader: Step 4: Generate form schema
    Loader->>Loader: schema = generate_schema(default)
    
    Loader-->>API: {default, override, merged, schema}
    deactivate Loader
    
    API-->>Bridge: StrategyConfig
    deactivate API
    
    Bridge-->>Store: Promise resolves
    Store->>Store: setCurrentConfig(config)
    Store-->>UI: Re-render ParameterEditor
    deactivate Store
    
    Note over UI: User edits parameters
    UI->>Store: dispatch: updateParam(key, value)
    Store->>Store: setStagedChanges({...staged, key: value})
    
    Note over UI: User clicks Save
    UI->>Store: dispatch: saveConfig()
    activate Store
    
    Store->>Bridge: window.pywebview.api.save_strategy_config(name, config)
    Bridge->>API: ConfigAPI.save_strategy_config(name, config)
    activate API
    
    Note over API: Validate before save
    API->>API: validate_config(config, schema)
    
    alt Validation fails
        API-->>Bridge: {success: false, errors: [...]}
        Bridge-->>Store: Error response
        Store->>Store: setErrors(errors)
    else Validation passes
        API->>JSON: write config/strategy_overrides/{name}.json
        JSON-->>API: Write success
        API-->>Bridge: {success: true, path: "..."}
        Bridge-->>Store: Success response
        Store->>Store: clearStagedChanges()
        Store->>UI: Show success toast
    end
    
    deactivate API
    deactivate Store
